codex
The exact-path smoke anchor is running under one Python process with all thread pools pinned to one and a 5 GiB address-space limit. The generator treats catalogue sizes 0 and 1 as hard-zero C3 rows, and builds invariant inputs only for size ≥2; that lets the eventual metrics expose whether the many structural zeros dominate, instead of quietly filtering them out.
