codex
Source review exposed a real C3-specific seam that I will disclose in the report: the declared route state is Q1+Q2 for both selected and incumbent members, but the current pilot context constructor wires Q1 only. The diagnostic therefore constructs the declared input explicitly while retaining the repository’s set pooling and sealed MLP literals. It also retains empty/singleton catalogue rows in evaluation even though production `CoalitionRow` correctly forbids training rows below size 2.
