## v2 primary, v1 secondary member inputs

V1 Q1 is the 16-slot schema at `src/mcrl/stagec_v025/state.py:14-16,29-46`;
Q2 has ten current fields plus three four-field horizon blocks, hence 22 slots
(`state.py:48-86`). The repaired v2 projection is defined by
