stored order before `sum` (`coalitions.py:248-251,275-283`); unlike payload
serialization, it does not sort them first (payload sorts at lines 165-179).
Floating summation order can therefore produce ULP-scale differences even when
the mathematical encoder is invariant. Report any nonzero empirical difference;
do not silently describe it as exact invariance.

