+# C3 declared-target learnability diagnostic
+
+Status: `DIAGNOSTIC_NOT_CLAIM`
+
+Completion criterion: `C3-DECLARED-TARGET-LEARNABILITY-2026-09-10.md` exists,
+its first line reports repaired-schema held-out ordering, level R2, top-1 versus
+the constant floor, the catalogue coalition-size distribution, and an
+architectural/informational ceiling classification; the report contains
+LOAO and LOWO metrics for v2 primary and v1 secondary, 2,000-replicate
+anchor-bootstrap intervals, sealed/linear/constant/high-capacity references,
+exact decomposition and singleton-zero checks, an empirical member-permutation
+test, exact-path module-flag and byte-identity receipts, per-anchor timing, and
+a printed peak-RSS line from every executable phase.
+
+The diagnostic is predictive-quality evidence only. It runs no production
+training, policy, acceptance test, or EE endpoint and changes no sealed file.

