then source objects released. Record per-anchor exact-generation wall time and
report anchor count plus mean/median/range (and preferably p05/p95) seconds per
anchor, mirroring C1's receipt fields in
`/home/sat/mcrl-v025-c1c2-ws/.scratch/c1-declared/generate_exact_rows.py:88-105`
and `:205-239`.

Before fitting, report:

- maximum absolute residual of `joint/kappa - (C1+C3)` (or the exactly equivalent
  rational identity) over every support row;
- maximum absolute `Psi` over all size-zero and size-one rows and counts checked;
  the demanded outcome is exact zero on every singleton; and
