codex
The fair constant reference for C3 is the anchor-respecting one: zero for empty/singleton candidates and a fold mean for nontrivial coalitions. Its top-1 is 0.2973 (the unconstrained literal-mean comparator is 0.000). This matters because the structure-aware constant also gets full-support ordering 0.6266 purely from separating forced zeros from nontrivial rows; on the nontrivial stratum its ordering is exactly 0.5. The final headline will therefore compare against 0.2973 and show both ordering views.
