+- v2 canonical schema: `66ed4a3f9222ac7f20f4334ffab92f6164d2dad203cbac7f7d4e1728ae4ad654`
+
+[RUN] Machine-readable evidence is under
+`.scratch/c3-declared/`: `row-summary.json`, the three generation receipts in
