The v2 primary LOAO fit is complete: full-support ordering 0.5484 (0.5797 on `|A|≥2`), level \(R^2=-0.0685\), and top-1 0.3243 versus the fair anchor-respecting constant’s 0.2973. The same-input linear/high-capacity references move LOAO level \(R^2\) to 0.0365/0.0488 but do not improve top-1, so the emerging diagnosis is mixed: architectural/optimization room for level calibration, but an informational-looking ceiling for coalition selection. Only the final v1 LOAO folds remain.
