+
+[RUN] Printed peak-RSS lines include:
+
+```text
+exact world 1 maximum: PEAK_RSS_KB=1748384
+exact world 2: PEAK_RSS_KB=1711904
+fit-cache expansion: PEAK_RSS_KB=32888
+PENDING FIT MAXIMUM
+```
+
+[RUN] The maximum observed process RSS was 1,748,384 KiB (1.668 GiB), below
