+
+[RUN] For v1 linear, the LOAO intervals are `R² [-0.9280,0.7091]`, ordering
+`[0.5021,0.5553]`, top-1 `[0.1892,0.4865]`; LOWO gives
+`[0.0165,0.6100]`, `[0.4670,0.5269]`, `[0.1351,0.4054]`. For v1
+high capacity, LOAO gives `[-1.3708,0.6914]`, `[0.5122,0.5571]`,
